  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.label>稜脊錘頭</UMW_Flanged.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is ridged with flanges that concentrate the force of a blow into a narrow edge, cracking armor plate rather than denting it. -->
  <UMW_Flanged.description>錘頭上有一道道稜脊，能把打擊的力量集中在狹窄的稜邊上，直接擊裂裝甲板，而不只是砸出凹痕。</UMW_Flanged.description>

  <!-- EN: flanged -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>稜脊</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: riving -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>劈裂</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: armor-cracking -->
  <UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>裂甲</UMW_Flanged.traitAdjectives.2>


