  <UMW_HeadWeighted.label>頭重</UMW_HeadWeighted.label>

  <!-- EN: The weight is gathered toward the striking end, so each swing lands harder but is slower to recover. -->
  <UMW_HeadWeighted.description>重量集中在打擊端，因此每次揮擊都更加沉重有力，但揮擊後恢復得較慢。</UMW_HeadWeighted.description>

