  <!-- EN: needle point -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.label>針尖</UMW_NeedlePoint.label>

  <!-- EN: The point is tapered to a fine needle that slips past bone and muscle to reach the organs beneath. Placing it cleanly takes slower, more deliberate thrusts. -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.description>尖端逐漸收窄成細針，能鑽過骨骼和肌肉，刺進底下的器官。不過要刺得精準，出手就得更慢、更謹慎。</UMW_NeedlePoint.description>

  <!-- EN: needle -->
  <UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>針鋒</UMW_NeedlePoint.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: needling -->
