  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.label>裝飾性</UMW_Ornamental.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon was crafted for aesthetics over functionality. It deals less damage but looks great. -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.description>這把武器為美觀打造而犧牲了其功能性。它造成的傷害較低，但外觀出眾。</UMW_Ornamental.description>

  <!-- EN: beautiful -->
