  <!-- EN: piledriver -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.label>打樁頭</UMW_Piledriver.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is built as a piledriver. The wielder can slam the weapon's full mass into the ground, sending a stunning shockwave through the earth. It stuns friend and foe alike, though the braced wielder is spared. Once used, the mechanism takes some time to reset. -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.description>錘頭採用打樁機的構造。使用者可以把它重重砸向地面，發出擊昏附近所有人的衝擊波，無論敵我，只有使用者本人能穩住身形。使用後，機構需要一段時間才能復位。</UMW_Piledriver.description>

  <!-- EN: piledriving -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>打樁</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: earthshaking -->
  <UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>撼地</UMW_Piledriver.traitAdjectives.1>

