  <UMW_Quilloned.label>劍格</UMW_Quilloned.label>

  <!-- EN: Quillons flare wide from the hilt, letting the wielder catch incoming blows and turn them aside. -->
  <UMW_Quilloned.description>劍格自劍柄向兩側大幅張開，讓持有者得以架住來襲的攻擊並將其盪開。</UMW_Quilloned.description>

