  <!-- EN: keen -->
  <UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>銳利</UMW_Razored.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: serrated -->
  <UMW_Serrated.label>鋸齒刃</UMW_Serrated.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is cut into vicious teeth that tear ragged, freely bleeding wounds, though they slash a little shallower than a clean edge. On a thrust the same teeth catch and rip flesh as the blade is drawn back. -->
  <UMW_Serrated.description>刃口被開出兇惡的鋸齒，會撕出參差不齊、血流不止的傷口，只是砍切深度略遜於平整的刃口。突刺時，這些鋸齒同樣會在刀身抽回時鉤住並撕裂血肉。</UMW_Serrated.description>

